        "text_k6Y2ck0qSoCeFdht": "<p>Because Lio works. 100,000+ people have already made the switch. We're confident that if you give it a real try, you'll see results. You have 30 days to use Lio and build your new routine. Real change takes time. We want you to give Lio a proper chance, not judge it after two days.</p><p><strong>Use it for a month. Build the habit. Then decide.</strong></p>",
